Subject: Adapt SONiC OpenSSL initialization to CPython 3.13

Preserve src/cpython.patch/openssl-config.patch: load the system OpenSSL
configuration when initializing _ssl. CPython 3.13 uses multi-phase module
initialization and removed the old PySocketModule setup context.
Source: Azure/sonic-fips@2ed0920f2fea7940f4b2b7f5c37e51e225eb1ea6

--- a/Modules/_ssl.c
+++ b/Modules/_ssl.c
@@ -6833,5 +6833,6 @@
 PyMODINIT_FUNC
 PyInit__ssl(void)
 {
+    OPENSSL_init_crypto(OPENSSL_INIT_LOAD_CONFIG, NULL);
     return PyModuleDef_Init(&_sslmodule_def);
 }
